SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -totals Ca C(4)
USER_PUNCH 1
    -headings density
    10 PUNCH RHO
END